<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active, fully steady with Monday.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1375 lbs 69.00-70.00, many 69.50-70.00, load reputation 70.50. Select 66.00-68.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 68.50-70.00, reputation 70.00; part load heifer mates 70.50. Select 66.00-68.00.</p>
</text>
